      },
      "text": "Arrive in La Paz.\n\nYou will be met at the airport and transferred to your hotel. After check-in, you have free time to rest and adjust to the altitude.\n\nLa Paz sits about 3,600 m above sea level. The city is known for its steep streets and its mix of Spanish and Indigenous cultures.\n\nThe 30 km Teleférico cable car network is another of the city's landmarks."
    },
    {
